[h1]Version 0.2.107.2:[/h1]
- now it is possible to buy or sell items in different quantities: hold Shift to sell or buy 10 items, hold Control to buy or sell 100 items, hold Ctrl+Shift to buy or sell all items in a stack;
- added support for Control key operations;
- fixed shaking screen issue introduced in 0.2.107;
- misc client fixes;

