[h1]Version 0.2.103:[/h1]
- lots of fixes for asteroid physics;
- ship speed re-balance;
- fixed issue when storage operations never affected Overload modifier and speed penalty;
- added despawn timer for loot floating in space - 60 minutes for player loot and 6 minutes for dropped out items;
- fixed issue with 'Phanom hunt' location;
- added online count information on login;
- some alterations to Player Criminal status;
- misc fixes and changes;

[h1]Version 0.2.104:[/h1]
- even more asteroid changes;
- huge CPU load optimization for stations;
- fixed weapon miss issues;
- some changes in the way how mobiles handle asteroids;
- added several World Bosses with rare loot;
- added Beryllium spawn near World Bosses;
- fixed issue that prevented starting important quest chain "That's the way the cookie crumbles";
- fixed issue with goods production on Fuel Station after upgrade;
- other improvements and optimizations;
 
[h1]Version 0.2.105:[/h1]
- removed tiny invisible obstacles in space;
- fixed issues with auto-complete quests (New Horizons, etc.);
- reduced damage for some top-level beam weapons;
- fixed issues with in-place resurrection, now you will be correctly redirected to your station or Amalthea on death in remote locations;
- world entrance scripts re-implemented to avoid quest failures (fixes missing turrets in Vivisector dungeon, key mobs in Fuel station quests, etc.);
- now you have 'Emergency teleport' item after completing all the quests for your own station. Item cooldown is 30 min;
- fixed top level Fuel station upgrade, now it correctly produces Capacitor and Patch items every 30-60 minutes;
- added icons for criminal statuses with timer;
- completing all upgrades for your station unlocks new Warehouse compartment (nothing inside yet);
- killing a player adds a value to Criminal timer instead of replacing it. NPC timers still as is - mobile kill resets the timer;
- increased drop rate for 'Drones dump' quest targets;
- changing equipment on station with filters turned on no longer cause items to disappear;
- revised speed and inertia of Alien drone;
- minor changes to station layout and compartment names;
- other changes and improvements;

[h1]Version 0.2.105.1:[/h1]
- fixed issues with button textures on some screens;
- fixed issue with missing menu for fuel station;
- fuel price reduced to 10 cr;
- fuel is now spawning in the storage of the fuel station;
- fixed Basic Cargo Module for Geologist profession (used to give +10 cargo capacity weighting 500 by itself);

